From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shayne <8741557+shaynelegault@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:44:09 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] mtd: apple-sftl: Recover interrupted saves and verify native
 reclamation

Select complete native checkpoints and require durable allocation roles
before allocating or retiring blocks. Recover interrupted context saves
and partial lane retirement read-only when the newer mapping is provable.
Reconcile replicated VFL banks and revalidate lane ownership on rotation.

Stage the alternate checkpoint from the normal writer, reload the whole
map on both sides of context retirement, and fail on ambiguous I/O.
Exercise interrupted operations on synthetic media. Keep physical P105
erase gated on native accounting and device qualification.

Assisted-by: LLM
